    <string name="onb_scenes_body">Work, Meet and Leave set the whole desk with one tap: lamp, plug, soundbar and Privacy Guard switch together, and every command shows up in the MQTT console.</string>
    <string name="onb_devices_title">Device control &amp; details</string>
    <string name="onb_devices_body">Tap a card for its details: brightness, audio output, the plug\'s auto-off timer, the LED schedule and sunset dimming. Automations keep working even when the app is closed.</string>
